{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0018258 O-linked glycosylation via hydroxyproline\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29770\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1W5lPGmMCTqtjOUD33hNWZYenX-KidCxr6RWBLrHAuG8/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nUniprot 8 @Antonialock \nTAIR 1 @tberardini \n\n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:0018258 | resid2go | RESID:AA0212 > GO:protein O-linked glycosylation via hydroxyproline ; GO:0018258\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-03T12:06:44Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to protein GO:0018258 O-linked glycosylation via hydroxyproline", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T10:14:03Z"}
